  "id": "giswqs/playa",
  "title": "Playa Wetlands",
  "description": "A compilation of playa wetland datasets for the United States, covering shallow, seasonal water bodies typical of arid and semi-arid regions. It combines watershed boundary (HUC8), National Wetlands Inventory, conservation easement, and derived playa morphometry (area, volume, depth) layers spanning over 5 million features, distributed as GeoPackage, GeoParquet, and PMTiles.",
